<title>USA: Webster Financial added to Russell 2000.</title>
<headline>Webster Financial added to Russell 2000.</headline>
<dateline>WATERBURY, Conn. 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Webster Financial Corp said on Thursday that it has been added to the Russell 2000 Index of small-capitalization U.S. stocks.</p>
<p>Webster said in a news release that it has a market capitalization of more than $500 million.</p>
<p>Webster is the holding company for Webster Bank, with $5.6 billion in assets and 78 offices in Connecticut.</p>
</text>
